--- Fires after vanilla input polling when a gamepad button is released. Includes joysticks enumerated by vanilla DirectInput and requires the game to initialize those devices. This observes raw state changes, including state resets when acquisition fails. It does not block game input.
--- @class gamepadButtonUpEventData
--- @field claim boolean If set to `true`, any lower-priority event callbacks will be skipped. Returning `false` will set this to `true`.
--- @field button integer *Read-only*. The zero-based DirectInput button ID, from 0 to 31. Device mappings vary.
--- @field gamepad integer *Read-only*. The zero-based gamepad ID.
